     The ggeettmmnnttooppttss() function appeared in 4.4BSD.  The bbuuiilldd__iioovveecc(),
     bbuuiilldd__iioovveecc__aarrggff(), ffrreeee__iioovveecc(), cchheecckkppaatthh(), and rrmmssllaasshheess() functions
     were added with nmount(8) in FreeBSD 5.0.  The ggeettmmnnttppooiinntt() and
     cchhkkddoorreellooaadd() functions were added in FreeBSD 13.2.

